{"slug":"love-beyond-the-grave-2026-djb4k8","title":"Love Beyond the Grave","titleEn":"Love Beyond the Grave","type":"series","year":2026,"rating":7.6,"duration":45,"description":"The exceptionally gifted Ghost King, He Simu, unexpectedly encounters the young general, Duan Xu, while out on a break, searching for food. This young general, who carries an item belonging to someone from He Simu's past, seems not to be the real Duan Xu. As they test each other through subtle exchanges, He Simu gradually uncovers the dark past and aspirations hidden within Duan Xu’s heart. In turn, Duan Xu discovers the steadfastness and loneliness that He Simu has endured. Despite the fleeting lifespan of a mortal, no more than a hundred years, and the four-hundred-year-old ghost who still retains the appearance of a young girl, they resist the relentless passage of time through their love.","genres":["اکشن","درام","ماجراجویی"],"poster":"/covers/tt32330809/poster.jpg","backdrop":"https://images.metahub.space/background/large/tt32330809/img","posterUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/small/tt32330809/img","backdropUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt32330809/img","videoUrl":"","trailerUrl":"https://youtube.com/watch?v=DBgm1agguRg","director":"Zoe Qin","cast":["Dilraba Dilmurat","Arthur Chen","Miles Wei"],"country":"چین","ageRating":"+13","quality":"1080p","sources":[],"featured":false,"trendingScore":76,"views":21318,"source":"od","addedAt":"2026-09-05T23:47:45.994Z","episodes":[{"season":1,"number":1,"name":"قسمت 1","synopsis":"","duration":45,"videoUrl":"https://dls9.aparatchi-dlcenter.top/DonyayeSerial/series4/tt32330809/SoftSub/S01/1080p.Web-DL/Love.Beyond.the.Grave.S01E01.1080p.Web-DL.SoftSub.DonyayeSerial.mkv","sources":[{"q":"1080p","v":"زیرنویس چسبیده","url":"https://dls9.aparatchi-dlcenter.top/DonyayeSerial/series4/tt32330809/SoftSub/S01/1080p.Web-DL/Love.Beyond.the.Grave.S01E01.1080p.Web-DL.SoftSub.DonyayeSerial.mkv"},{"q":"720p","v":"زیرنویس چسبیده","ur